constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 10^{3}

expected time complexity: O(N)
expected auxiliary space: O(N)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def createTree(self, parent, N):
		pos = []
		for i in range(0, N):
			x = Node(i)
			pos.append(x)
		for i in range(0, N):
			if parent[i] == -1:
				root = pos[i]
			elif pos[parent[i]].left is None:
				pos[parent[i]].left = pos[i]
			else:
				pos[parent[i]].right = pos[i]
		return root
